[00:29.05] " I stole a ride... on a passing star...
[00:34.26] Not knowing where I was going, how near or how far."
[00:45.32] " Through years of light... lands of future and past...
[00:50.35] 'Til the Heavenly gates... were sighted at last. "
[01:15.03] " Star-rider... (rider-RIDER)
[01:19.23] ... take me to the stars. "
[01:27.14] " Star-rider... (rider-RIDER)
[01:32.00] ... show me where you are! "
[01:41.00] " Northern Lights flash by... and then they were gone...
[01:46.61] And the old stars were dying... so the new ones were born."
[01:57.82] " Ever on our own... celestial ways...
[02:03.03] And in the light of my years... shown the rest of my days. "
[02:14.59] " Speed increasing, all control is in the hands of those who know! "
[02:21.49] " Will they help us grow?... to one day be - star*riders! "
[02:39.87] " Star-rider... (rider-RIDER)
[02:45.35] ... show me where you are."
[02:52.60] " Star-rider... (rider-RIDER)
[02:57.63] ... take me to the stars!"
